], [6.826821, "reasoning", " with engaging tone"], [6.8455, "reasoning", ".\n"], [6.845546, "content", "\n\nImagine your phone is"], [6.865025, "content", " playing"], [6.88416, "content", " a game. Behind"], [6.903961, "content", " the"], [6.92303, "content", " smooth"], [6.942568, "content", " graphics"], [6.962197, "content", ", your"], [6.981591, "content", " CPU is doing"], [7.001178, "content", " something"], [7.02082, "content", " like the"], [7.040169, "content", " world"], [7.059592, "content", "’s fastest"], [7.078915, "content", ", smart"], [7.098508, "content", "est kitchen,"], [7.118062, "content", " racing"], [7.137554, "content", " to"], [7.156846, "content", " prepare"], [7.176174, "content", " millions"], [7.19562, "content", " of tiny orders"], [7.215032, "content", " every second.\n\nA"], [7.234406, "content", " program"], [7.254052, "content", " is just a long"], [7.27345, "content", " list of instructions: “"], [7.293162, "content", "load"], [7.312367, "content", " this number,” “add it"], [7.332137, "content", " to"], [7.35165, "content", " that"], [7.371315, "content", " one"], [7.390639, "content", ",” “jump"], [7.411274, "content", " to another"], [7.430916, "content", " place"], [7.450358, "content", ",” “save"], [7.469762, "content", " the"], [7.48948, "content", " result.” The CPU’s job"], [7.509009, "content", " is to follow that"], [7.528572, "content", " list, but it"], [7.547635, "content", " does it in"], [7.567251, "content", " a much"], [7.586941, "content", " smarter"], [7.606386, "content", " way"], [7.626028, "content", " than just"], [7.645859, "content", " doing"], [7.665064, "content", " one thing"], [7.684233, "content", " after another"], [7.703783, "content", ".\n\n##"], [7.723266, "content", " 1. Pip"], [7.744736, "content", "el"], [7.764476, "content", "ining: the assembly line\n\n"], [7.783987, "content", "If"], [7.803323, "content", " the CPU only did"], [7.822712, "content", " one instruction at a time, it would"], [7.842277, "content", " be slow.\n\nInstead"], [7.861878, "content", ", it uses a **pipeline**,"], [7.881118, "content", " like an assembly line.\n\nThink"], [7.900828, "content", " of making"], [7.920468, "content", " a smooth"], [7.939948, "content", "ie:\n\n1. Get"], [7.959509, "content", " fruit  \n2. Cut"], [7.979176, "content", " it"], [7.998447, "content", "  \n3. Blend"], [8.018232, "content", " it  \n4. Pour"], [8.037796, "content", " it into a cup"], [8.057009, "content", "  \n\nIf"], [8.076801, "content", " only"], [8.09626, "content", " one smoothie goes"], [8.115682, "content", " through the whole"], [8.135262, "content", " process"], [8.154889, "content", " at a time, you"], [8.173864, "content", " finish"], [8.193302, "content", " slowly.\n\n"], [8.212667, "content", "But with"], [8.232032, "content", " a pipeline, multiple"], [8.251558, "content", " smoothies can be in different"], [8.270964, "content", " stages at the"], [8.290659, "content", " same time:\n\n- One is"], [8.309887, "content", " being cut  \n"], [8.329181, "content", "- One"], [8.348696, "content", " is being blended  \n- One is being"], [8.367848, "content", " poured  \n- A"], [8.387249, "content", " new one is having"], [8.406914, "content", " fruit added"], [8.426495, "content", "  \n\nThe CPU does"], [8.445444, "content", " something"], [8.465323, "content", " similar. Each instruction moves"], [8.484644, "content", " through stages:"], [8.503973, "content", "\n\n- **Fetch**:"], [8.523345, "content", " grab the instruction from memory  \n- **"], [8.542843, "content", "Decode**: figure"], [8.562242, "content", " out what it means  \n- **Execute"], [8.581646, "content", "**: do the"], [8.601449, "content", " math or"], [8.620844, "content", " logic"], [8.640771, "content", "  \n- **Write"], [8.659564, "content", " back**: save"], [8.678816, "content", " the result  \n\nSo while"], [8.698377, "content", " one instruction is being"], [8.717785, "content", " executed, the next one"], [8.73766, "content", " might be decoding"], [8.757419, "content", ", and the next one after"], [8.776559, "content", " that might still"], [8.796145, "content", " being fetched.\n\nThis is like how"], [8.815344, "content", " a"], [8.834807, "content", " highway"], [8.854356, "content", " can have"], [8.873824, "content", " many cars at"], [8.893817, "content", " once, each in"], [8.913343, "content", " a different part"], [8.93313, "content", " of the"], [8.952693, "content", " road. No"], [8.971837, "content", " single car is super"], [8.99125, "content", " fast, but the overall"], [9.010588, "content", " flow is"], [9.029988, "content", " much"], [9.049724, "content", " faster.\n\nModern CPUs actually have"], [9.068961, "content", " several pipelines"], [9.08853, "content", ","], [9.107969, "content", " not"], [9.126968, "content", " just one,"], [9.14633, "content", " so they can start multiple"], [9.16588, "content", " instructions at the"], [9.185163, "content", " same time.\n\n## 2."], [9.204819, "content", " Out-of-order execution: doing"], [9.224045, "content", " things"], [9.243931, "content", " in the fastest"], [9.262738, "content", " order"], [9.282162, "content", "\n\nSometimes waiting"], [9.301765, "content", " is"], [9.321313, "content", " wasted"], [9.340467, "content", " time"], [9.360172, "content", ".\n\nSuppose you are"], [9.379467, "content", " cooking dinner"], [9.398894, "content", ". You need to boil"], [9.418475, "content", " water for"], [9.438208, "content", " pasta, but while"], [9.458002, "content", " the water is"], [9.477342, "content", " heating, you don"], [9.496536, "content", "’t just"], [9.51608, "content", " stand"], [9.535614, "content", " there. You chop"], [9.554997, "content", " vegetables, grate"], [9.574399, "content", " cheese"], [9.593933, "content", ", or set the"], [9.613825, "content", " table.\n\nCP"], [9.633128, "content", "Us do something"], [9.652436, "content", " similar with"], [9.672055, "content", " **out-of-order execution**.\n\nIf"], [9.691497, "content", " one"], [9.710787, "content", " part"], [9.730374, "content", " of a"], [9.750094, "content", " program is waiting for something"], [9.76991, "content", " else"], [9.78897, "content", " to"], [9.808651, "content", " finish, the CPU can run"], [9.828035, "content", " other ready"], [9.847542, "content", " instructions first.\n\nFor"], [9.867262, "content", " example:\n\n- Instruction"], [9.886646, "content", " A: add"], [9.905994, "content", " "], [9.925397, "content", "2 + 3  \n- Instruction B"], [9.944697, "content", ": wait for a"], [9.964463, "content", " number"], [9.983975, "content", " from memory"], [10.003265, "content", "  \n- Instruction C: multiply "], [10.022646, "content", "4 ×"], [10.042548, "content", " 5  \n\nIf B"], [10.061834, "content", " is waiting, the"], [10.08102, "content", " CPU doesn’t sit"], [10.100467, "content", " idle"], [10.120224, "content", ". It can do"], [10.139523, "content", " A and C while waiting"], [10.159355, "content", " for B.\n\nThis is like"], [10.178417, "content", " a project"], [10.198037, "content", " where"], [10.217794, "content", " you do the"], [10.237083, "content", " easy"], [10.256572, "content", " independent"], [10.276236, "content", " parts first while"], [10.295434, "content", " waiting"], [10.314756, "content", " for something"], [10.334621, "content", " else"], [10.354042, "content", ".\n\nBut there’s"], [10.373713, "content", " a catch: the final"], [10.393353, "content", " result"], [10.412983, "content", " must look"], [10.432646, "content", " like"], [10.451655, "content", " the instructions"], [10.470954, "content", " happened in the correct order.\n\nSo"], [10.490535, "content", " the CPU keeps track"], [10.510334, "content", " of everything"], [10.529641, "content", ". It can"], [10.549287, "content", " execute things"], [10.568458, "content", " out"], [10.588289, "content", " of order internally"], [10.607515, "content", ", but when it reports"], [10.62718, "content", " the final"], [10.646693, "content", " results to the program"], [10.666256, "content", ", it “ret"], [10.685591, "content", "ires” them"], [10.705136, "content", " in the original order."], [10.724509, "content", "\n\nThink of it like a restaurant"], [10.744317, "content", ": the kitchen may"], [10.763528, "content", " cook the dessert"], [10.783047, "content", ", soup"], [10.802322, "content", ", and main dish"], [10.822082, "content", " in any order that"], [10.841546, "content", " keeps"], [10.861087, "content", " the chefs"], [10.880484, "content", " busy, but the waiter"], [10.899779, "content", " still serves the food"], [10.919333, "content", " to the table"], [10.938809, "content", " in the order it"], [10.958348, "content", " should appear"], [10.977765, "content", ".\n\nThis"], [10.997156, "content", " is"], [11.016583, "content", " one"], [11.036256, "content", " of the main reasons"], [11.055661, "content", " modern CPUs are"], [11.075084, "content", " so fast:"], [11.094617, "content", " they keep all"], [11.11425, "content", " their"], [11.133579, "content", " worker"], [11.152946, "content", " units busy instead"], [11.172623, "content", " of letting"], [11.192146, "content", " them wait.\n\n## 3."], [11.211632, "content", " Branch prediction: guessing what"], [11.231357, "content", " will happen next"], [11.250845, "content", "\n\nProgram"], [11.269896, "content", "s often have choices.\n\nFor"], [11.289666, "content", " example:"], [11.308759, "content", "\n\n```text"], [11.328477, "content", "\nif ("], [11.348178, "content", "score >"], [11.367462, "content", " 100) {"], [11.387013, "content", "\n    print"], [11.406671, "content", " \"level up"], [11.426235, "content", "\"\n} else {\n    print"], [11.445489, "content", " \"keep going"], [11.465346, "content", "\"\n}\n```\n\nThis"], [11.484501, "content", " is called"], [11.50402, "content", " a **branch**"], [11.523735, "content", " because the program"], [11.543144, "content", " goes"], [11.562056, "content", " one"], [11.581745, "content", " way"], [11.601107, "content", " or another.\n\nThe problem"], [11.620241, "content", " is"], [11.640066, "content", ": the"], [11.659484, "content", " CPU often"], [11.679211, "content", " has to wait"], [11.698632, "content", " to"], [11.71824, "content", " know"], [11.737512, "content", " which path"], [11.75671, "content", " to take"], [11.776406, "content", ".\n\nIf"], [11.795939, "content", " it"], [11.815467, "content", " just"], [11.834711, "content", " stopped and"], [11.854159, "content", " waited"], [11.873815, "content", " for"], [11.89342, "content", " the"], [11.912925, "content", " answer, the pipeline would fill"], [11.932323, "content", " with"], [11.951696, "content", " empty space"], [11.97151, "content", ".\n\nSo CPUs"], [11.990772, "content", " **"], [12.010364, "content", "guess**."], [12.029811, "content", "\n\nThis is **"], [12.049361, "content", "branch prediction**.\n\nImagine walking"], [12.068765, "content", " to school"], [12.088247, "content", ". You"], [12.107594, "content", " reach"], [12.127083, "content", " a stop"], [12.146299, "content", "light"], [12.166196, "content", "."], [12.185237, "content", " Before you even"], [12.204846, "content", " see it clearly"], [12.224266, "content", ", you start"], [12.243924, "content", " walking"], [12.26314, "content", " because"], [12.282649, "content", " you expect"], [12.302092, "content", " it will"], [12.321421, "content", " be green. If it"], [12.341106, "content", "’s actually"], [12.360495, "content", " red, you stop. If you"], [12.380083, "content", " guessed"], [12.399451, "content", " right, you saved"], [12.418746, "content", " time.\n\nThe"], [12.438472, "content", " CPU does the same thing"], [12.457613, "content", ". It"], [12.477278, "content", " predicts which branch will happen"], [12.49668, "content", " and"], [12.516346, "content", " starts"], [12.53577, "content", " working"], [12.554926, "content", " down"], [12.574467, "content", " that path right"], [12.593767, "content", " away.\n\nModern"], [12.613238, "content", " CPUs are"], [12.632625, "content", " very"], [12.652202, "content", " good at this because"], [12.671419, "content", " programs"], [12.69074, "content", " often repeat patterns. For example:\n\n"], [12.710577, "content", "- a"], [12.729816, "content", " loop usually"], [12.751828, "content", " continues"], [12.771344, "content", " many"], [12.790848, "content", " times  \n- a condition often has"], [12.809975, "content", " the same result"], [12.829654, "content", "  \n"], [12.849055, "content", "- an error check usually fails"], [12.868598, "content", "  \n\nThe"], [12.888357, "content", " CPU learns from the recent past"], [12.907873, "content", ". If the branch went"], [12.927274, "content", " “yes” many times in"], [12.946592, "content", " a row, it"], [12.96598, "content", " predicts “"], [12.985643, "content", "yes” again"], [13.004895, "content", ".\n\nIf the guess"], [13.024592, "content", " is right, everything"], [13.043827, "content", " flows"], [13.063526, "content", " smoothly.\n\nIf the guess is wrong"], [13.083265, "content", ", the CPU has to throw"], [13.102333, "content", " away"], [13.121718, "content", " the work"], [13.141387, "content", " it did down"], [13.160841, "content", " the wrong path and restart with"], [13.180345, "content", " the correct one"], [13.199479, "content", ". This"], [13.218838, "content", " is called a **branch"], [13.238423, "content", " misprediction"], [13.257716, "content", "**.\n\nIt’s"], [13.277127, "content", " like guessing"], [13.29664, "content", " your"], [13.316304, "content", " friend"], [13.335821, "content", " is going to turn"], [13.355366, "content", " left"], [13.374697, "content", ", and then realizing"], [13.394445, "content", " they turned"], [13.413833, "content", " right. You have to turn back"], [13.433421, "content", " around and lose"], [13.45276, "content", " a little time"], [13.472448, "content", ".\n\nThis is why even"], [13.491886, "content", " very"], [13.511311, "content", " fast CPUs"], [13.530913, "content", " still"], [13.550198, "content", " care a"], [13.569868, "content", " lot about prediction: a"], [13.589132, "content", " wrong guess can"], [13.608869, "content", " waste"], [13.628357, "content", " a lot"], [13.648007, "content", " of work.\n\n## 4."], [13.66722, "content", " Caches: the fast little"], [13.686604, "content", " shelf right"], [13.706034, "content", " next to you"], [13.725662, "content", "\n\nThe"], [13.745102, "content", " CPU is"], [13.764788, "content", " extremely fast. Memory"], [13.784136, "content", ","], [13.803578, "content", " though,"], [13.8232, "content", " is relatively"], [13.842683, "content", " slower.\n\nThat’s"], [13.861956, "content", " why CPUs"], [13.881659, "content", " use **caches**.\n\nA"], [13.901133, "content", " cache is a"], [13.920854, "content", " tiny, very fast storage"], [13.940228, "content", " area that holds"], [13.959733, "content", " things"], [13.97948, "content", " the CPU is likely"], [13.998865, "content", " to use soon"], [14.018631, "content", ".\n\nImagine you"], [14.038182, "content", "’re baking"], [14.057631, "content", "."], [14.077097, "content", " You could"], [14.096512, "content", " run"], [14.115953, "content", " to"], [14.135746, "content", " the far warehouse"], [14.155262, "content", " every"], [14.174359, "content", " time you need"], [14.193808, "content", " a spoon, flour, or egg"], [14.213446, "content", ". That would be too slow.\n\n"], [14.232783, "content", "Instead, you keep"], [14.252427, "content", " a small counter"], [14.271842, "content", " near your workspace"], [14.291485, "content", " with"], [14.310784, "content", " the"], [14.330312, "content", " things you’re"], [14.349844, "content", " probably going"], [14.3695, "content", " to need next.\n\nThat"], [14.388774, "content", " counter"], [14.408523, "content", " is the cache.\n\nCPU memory"], [14.427844, "content", " works"], [14.447313, "content", " in"], [14.466602, "content", " layers"], [14.486278, "content", ":\n\n- **L"], [14.50593, "content", "1 cache**: tiny"], [14.525465, "content", " and"], [14.54477, "content", " super fast, right next"], [14.563862, "content", " to the CPU  \n- **L2"], [14.58365, "content", " cache**: bigger"], [14.603404, "content", ", slightly"], [14.619616, "content", " slower"]], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 90, "total_tokens": 2138, "completion_tokens": 2048, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "reasoning_tokens": 821}, "finish": "length", "ttft_s": 0.127012, "t_last_s": 14.619616, "t_end_s": 14.620047700009309, "completion_tokens": 2048, "decode_tok_s": 141.24445820778655, "captured": "2026-11-01 08:10:55"}